    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "DJ Blizzard aka BigBlizz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110884668885041345992/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrc5KFvfmJZnu1cQsCHmi1sMCxDjkAN0SbquvJwueE1mP4p4HK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Went for breakfast on the weekend after the boys had soccer. They had never been there before and they loved it. They both ordered the same thing from the kids menu and both finished everything. My fiance got the maple skillet which was lacking flavour from the potatoes, to the hollandaise sauce. I ordered the Philly Benny which was really good but again the hollandaise sauce was a little runny and lacking flavour but everything was great. The boys loved their milkshakes and the smoothie I ordered was really good",
        "time": 1761673960,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noah Satim",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111601361564502655426/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzcjyatnBaNTxAKKLNBILRCFHDvc0Y9vvxwS_E7Tkc6CmUQduDjw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We absolutely loved our visit to L’Œufrier in Notre-Dame-de-l’Île-Perrot 😊❤️🙏🏼 We came to celebrate my birthday, and from the moment we walked in, Nitpreet and Jay were so kind and heartfelt. Their genuine warmth made us feel like family.\n\nI had the Beyond Egg Benedict and it was bursting with fresh vegetables and flavour—absolutely delicious! My family tried a variety of dishes, and everyone left feeling happy, content, and well cared for. We were enjoying ourselves so much that we completely forgot to take food photos… probably the best compliment a restaurant can get—we couldn’t wait, we just dug in!\n\nThank you, Nitpreet and Jay, for turning a simple breakfast into a memory filled with Mettā, joy, and gratitude 🌸✨",
        "time": 1756926700,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jimmy K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103108772416379940319/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIknrWT4W76UIV9IHDhXh8SDBCfM5sZVcqWxZYmXyuDBVSemg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "While waiting for our meal to arrive at our table I was watching Brin pick up soiled dishes from other tables. I was impressed with the quality of her work. She was quick and meticulous with a smile on her face. While Brin was setting up a table an unused set of fork, knife and spoon fell on the floor and she disposed of it right away. She took the set apart and put them with the used soiled dishes. I was so impressed because I thought that it would be placed on the table anyways. I called her over to my table to praise her for her quality of work. Brin keep the great work!!! and Thank you.",
        "time": 1763242295,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Loghan Kelman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100234254474910494816/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLNfaeQ5mMyg3d6IOe20T9fbFqgfrSGe2O8LnWFhH62-G7Oq6U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We came here while traveling & Nit went above & beyond. Very knowledgeable of the menu & kind…The food was also great!😊",
        "time": 1765454660,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
